msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeCueGrounding|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "event-type cue grounding"
msgstr "按事件类型扎根线索"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeCueGrounding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The opt-in cue-grounding policy that seeds machinery from six exact event kinds and propagates it through event containment, generation, facets, known-unknown subjects and evaluation contexts without individual admission."
msgstr "显式选择的线索扎根策略，从六种确切事件类型建立机制分类，并沿事件包含、生成、分面、已知未知主题及评估上下文传播，无需逐条准入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeCueGrounding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the reader explicitly selects event-kind classification and the declared forward links without individual machinery admission."
msgstr "当读者明确选择按事件类型分类及声明的正向关系，且不要求逐条机制准入时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeCueGrounding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid combining this policy with another machinery interpretation for the same reader and world, or treating classification as automation or authorship evidence."
msgstr "避免将本策略与同一读者及世界的其他机制解释混合，也不要将分类视为自动化或作者身份的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeCueGrounding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select all twelve rule members for the actual reader and world, finish positive machinery closure, then apply the shared negative cue-eligibility rule. Preserve source provenance independently."
msgstr "为实际读者及世界选择全部十二个规则成员，完成正向机制闭包，再应用共享的否定线索资格规则。独立保留来源溯源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeCueGrounding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This policy does not publish MachineryRecord type or invent machineryAdmittedBy facts. Its shared binary state requires one policy interpretation per reader and world. The boundary is an operation-input contract, not authenticated runtime isolation."
msgstr "本策略不发布 MachineryRecord 类型，也不臆造 machineryAdmittedBy 事实。共享的二元状态要求每个读者与世界仅有一种策略解释。该边界是操作输入契约，不是经认证的运行时隔离。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeCueGrounding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A cue can select this policy while another release retains operationalCueGrounding; their same-reader interpretations remain in separate operation worlds."
msgstr "线索可以选择本策略，而另一个版本保留 operationalCueGrounding；两者对同一读者的解释保持在独立操作世界中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryAttemptRootRule|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "attempt event-kind machinery root"
msgstr "尝试事件类型机制根"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryAttemptRootRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Derive machineryForReader for an Event carrying eventTypeAttempt under the selected event-type policy, without individual admission or an intention-target prerequisite."
msgstr "在选定事件类型策略下，为具有 eventTypeAttempt 的 Event 派生 machineryForReader，不要求逐条准入或意图目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryAttemptRootRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the selected policy classifies an actual attempt Event by its exact event type."
msgstr "当选定策略按确切事件类型分类实际的尝试 Event 时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryAttemptRootRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring automation, goal satisfaction or lifecycle execution. Other event kinds do not match this root."
msgstr "避免推断自动化、目标满足或生命周期执行。其他事件类型不匹配此根。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryAttemptRootRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join the original Event and its eventTypeAttempt value to the same reader’s explicit selection of this rule’s set."
msgstr "将原始 Event 及其 eventTypeAttempt 值与同一读者对本规则集合的明确选择连接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryAttemptRootRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every clause requires positive selection of its containing set and its own membership, retaining the same reader. Select one policy interpretation per reader and world; no execution or authorship is certified."
msgstr "每个子句要求明确选择其所属集合及其自身成员关系，并保持同一读者。每个读者与世界只选择一种策略解释；不认证执行或作者身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryAttemptRootRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An Event with eventTypeAttempt can be classified without minting a machineryAdmittedBy assertion."
msgstr "具有 eventTypeAttempt 的 Event 可以被分类，而不生成 machineryAdmittedBy 断言。"

