msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryDescendantRule|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "event descendant machinery propagation"
msgstr "后代事件机制传播"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryDescendantRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Propagate machinery from a classified containing Event to its subEventOf Event descendants for the same reader, without individual admission."
msgstr "对同一读者，将已分类包含 Event 的机制状态沿 subEventOf 传播至其后代 Event，无需逐条准入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryDescendantRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain event decomposition in the selected event-type policy."
msgstr "用于在选定事件类型策略中保留事件分解。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryDescendantRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reversing containment or treating temporal overlap as event decomposition."
msgstr "避免反转包含关系，或将时间重叠视为事件分解。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryDescendantRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Join child subEventOf parent with both Event types and the parent’s same-reader machinery state. Transitive closure may supply nested descendants."
msgstr "连接子事件 subEventOf 父事件、两端的 Event 类型及父事件对同一读者的机制状态。传递闭包可提供嵌套后代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EventTypeMachineryDescendantRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
